{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:725","content":{"id":725,"title":"二叉树的最近公共祖先","content":[{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}],"disableDrag":false,"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给定一个二叉树, 找到该树中两个指定节点的最近公共祖先。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"        3\n       / \\\n      5   1\n     / \\ / \\\n    6  2 0 8\n      / \\\n     7   4","language":"","uuid":"1728d65d-f322-4270-b15e-16396ad14fcf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例1","open":true,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入：root = [3,5,1,6,2,0,8,null,null,7,4], p = 5, q = 1"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出：3"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解释：节点 5 和节点 1 的最近公共祖先是节点 3 。"}]}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例2","open":true,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入：root = [3,5,1,6,2,0,8,null,null,7,4], p = 5, q = 4"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出：5"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解释：节点 5 和节点 4 的最近公共祖先是节点 5 。因为根据定义最近公共祖先节点可以为节点本身"}]}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例3","open":true,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入：root = [1,2], p = 1, q = 2"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出：1"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提示："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"树中节点数目在范围 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"[2, 10^5]","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[2, 10^5]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 内。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"-10^9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"-10^9"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" <= "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.val","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" <= "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"10^9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"10^9"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所有 Node.val 互不相同 。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"p != q","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"q","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 均存在于给定的二叉树中。"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}],"disableDrag":false,"level":2},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"收集父节点的路径"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"遍历树，并使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Map","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 存储节点和节点的父节点的关系，从 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开始收集所有的父元素路径存储在一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Set","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，接着从 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"q","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开始收集父元素，判断是否在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Set","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，第一个在的就是最近公共祖先。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"function lowestCommonAncestor(root: TreeNode | null, p: TreeNode | null, q: TreeNode | null): TreeNode | null {\n\tif (root === null) return null;\n  const map = new Map<TreeNode, TreeNode>();\n  dfs(root, map);\n  const set = new Set<TreeNode>();\n  while(p) {\n    set.add(p);\n    p = map.get(p);\n  }\n\n  while(q) {\n    if (set.has(q)) {\n      return q;\n    }\n    q = map.get(q);\n  }\n\n  return null;\n};\n\nconst dfs = (root:TreeNode | null, map: Map<TreeNode, TreeNode>) => {\n  if (!root) return;\n  if (root.left) {\n    map.set(root.left, root);\n    dfs(root.left, map);\n  }\n  if (root.right) {\n    map.set(root.right, root);\n    dfs(root.right, map);\n  }\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"58673284-2725-4293-9983-d367a2df263b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"递归"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要重新定义下 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"lowestCommonAncestor","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的语义，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"如果该树中存在 ","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"q","code":true},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":" 则返回最近公共祖先，如果只有一个存在则返回对应的节点，都不存在返回 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"null","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因为题目保证了一定存在公共祖先，因此该返回的就是最近公共祖先，对子树递归结果的处理分为三种情况："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果左右子树都返回值，说明值分别在两颗子树中，则返回 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"root","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果只有左子树有值，全在左子树中，返回左子树"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果只有右子树有值，全在右子树中，返回右子树"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么时候终止递归呢？当 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"root","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"q","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的时候，假设 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"root === p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，分为两种情况："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"q","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不在树中，根据函数含义，应当返回 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"root","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"q","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在树中，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 本身就是二者的最近公共祖先，返回 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"root","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"function lowestCommonAncestor(root: TreeNode | null, p: TreeNode | null, q: TreeNode | null): TreeNode | null {\n\tif (root === null) return null;\n  if (p === root || q === root) return root;\n  const left = lowestCommonAncestor(root.left, p, q);\n  const right = lowestCommonAncestor(root.right, p, q);\n  if (left && right) return root;\n  if (left) return left;\n  if (right) return right;\n\n  return null;\n};","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"fb7617e6-46df-4a2d-b27d-9d5310026497","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}],"level":2},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode.cn/problems/lowest-common-ancestor-of-a-binary-tree/description/","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"236. 二叉树的最近公共祖先"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode.cn/problems/lowest-common-ancestor-of-a-binary-tree/solutions/238552/er-cha-shu-de-zui-jin-gong-gong-zu-xian-by-leetc-2/comments/2386858/","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题解及评论"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"树"},{"label":"二叉树的最近公共祖先","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:725","type":"doc","id":725}}],"prevPage":{"title":"不同的二叉搜索树","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:677","type":"doc","id":677}},"nextPage":{"title":"简化路径","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:694","type":"doc","id":694}},"createTime":1744808078912,"updateTime":1744859589133,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744859589133}}